<title>SPAIN: Spain's ICO 1996 net profit rose to 19.1 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's ICO 1996 net profit rose to 19.1 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Official Credit Institute (ICO) said on Monday its 1996 net profit rose to 19.105 billion pesetas, up 181.37 percent from 1995.</p>
<p>Net interest income was 20.64 billion pesetas, while operating profit stood at 16.49 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were given.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
